{"ticker":"CDNS","updated":"2026-10-23T22:44:57Z","profile":{"longName":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc.","shortName":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cadence.com","fullTimeEmployees":15445,"marketCap":87159128064,"trailingPE":62.92047,"forwardPE":33.07209,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":14.930586,"pegRatio":2.37,"targetMeanPrice":406.2404,"targetHighPrice":470.0,"targetLowPrice":300.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.242,"earningsGrowth":1.254,"grossMargins":0.85871005,"operatingMargins":0.28575,"profitMargins":0.23605,"totalRevenue":5837622784,"beta":1.128,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":416.69,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":262.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc. develops computational, AI-driven software, hardware, and silicon intellectual property products and solutions. The company offers functional verification services, such as Jasper, a formal verification platform; Xcelium, a parallel logic simulation platform; Verisium, a generative AI solution; Palladium, an enterprise emulation platform; and Protium, a prototyping platform for chip verification, as well as digital IC design and sign off products, including Innovus platform; and custom IC design and simulation product include Virtuoso, a platform to design and verify analog. It also provides Xcelium logic simulator and other front-end verification and virtual prototyping technologies; controllers and physical interfaces; PCI Express, universal accelerator and compute express links, and multiple memory interfaces; and Tensilica, a digital signal processor. In addition, the company's design IP portfolio includes serializer/deserializer, peripheral component interconnect, USB, and other standard protocols; and Secure-IC, a solution for embedded security IP. Additionally, it provides System Design and Analysis (SD&A) platform, a solution that enables end-to-end system-level design and verification across chips, packages, PCBs, and electronic systems; Allegro X and Orca X platforms for PCB and advanced packaging; Sigrity X for signal and power integrity;","summary_zh":"Cadence Design Systems, Inc. 開發計算、人工智慧驅動的軟體、硬體和矽知識產權產品和解決方案。本公司提供功能驗證服務，如形式化驗證平台Jasper； Xcelium，平行邏輯模擬平台； Verisium，生成式人工智慧解決方案； Palladium，企業模擬平台； Protium，一個用於晶片驗證的原型平台，以及數位 IC 設計和簽核產品，包括 Innovus 平台；客製化 IC 設計和驗證產品包括 Virtuoso，這是一個設計和驗證的模擬平台。還提供Xcelium邏輯模擬器等前端驗證和虛擬樣機技術；控制器和實體介面； PCI Express、通用加速器和計算高速鏈路以及多個記憶體介面；和 Tensilica，一種數位訊號處理器。此外，該公司的設計IP組合包括串行器/解串器、外圍組件互連、USB和其他標準協議；Secure-IC，嵌入式安全IP解決方案。此外，它還提供系統設計和分析 (SD&A) 平台，可實現跨晶片、封裝、PCB 和電子系統的端到端系統級設計和驗證；用於 PCB 和先進封裝的 Allegro X 和 Orca X 平台； Sigrity X 確保訊號和電源完整性；","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":347.0,"h":349.05,"l":344.66,"c":345.19,"v":1022400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":344.14,"h":345.56,"l":343.14,"c":344.03,"v":1718600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":345.0,"h":347.68,"l":343.11,"c":346.88,"v":1069800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":347.72,"h":355.49,"l":347.72,"c":354.29,"v":1081300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":353.6,"h":355.23,"l":346.19,"c":350.43,"v":1304300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":343.95,"h":346.86,"l":340.67,"c":342.81,"v":1202500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":340.88,"h":347.43,"l":340.57,"c":347.32,"v":1141100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":346.93,"h":350.12,"l":344.43,"c":349.33,"v":905400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":353.03,"h":355.31,"l":345.88,"c":351.01,"v":1115800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":353.67,"h":361.36,"l":353.0,"c":360.64,"v":1773400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":362.0,"h":362.71,"l":356.4,"c":361.77,"v":1271800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":348.5,"h":348.53,"l":326.35,"c":338.53,"v":5847800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":342.36,"h":357.76,"l":338.9,"c":354.7,"v":3571600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":353.47,"h":355.07,"l":342.09,"c":343.48,"v":1616900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":343.17,"h":352.0,"l":342.26,"c":351.52,"v":1405100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":350.17,"h":352.57,"l":347.95,"